	########################################################################################################################
	#
	#                                    Install piper Text-to-Speech (SYSTEM-WIDE)
	#
	# This code block installs Piper-TTS in a global virtual environment and automates its accessibility.
	# It handles:
	#   - Installation of system dependencies.
	#   - Virtual environment creation in /usr/local/bin/xtts.
	#   - Patching the 'activate' script for the new system-wide path.
	#   - System-wide PATH integration via /etc/profile using standard project conventions.
